; electron-vite's latest stable release (5.0.0) declares a peer range of
; `vite: ^5 || ^6 || ^7`, while this project builds on Vite 8, which every other
; tool in the tree (vitest, @vitejs/plugin-react, vite-tsconfig-paths) requires.
; Without this, `npm install` aborts with ERESOLVE on a fresh clone. Drop this
; line once electron-vite ships a release that accepts Vite 8.
legacy-peer-deps=true
